Z||000008||DRH||09-04-2001||12:11 AM||||I missed the Fiero.<P>Very cool show though! Like David Copperfield without the huge set. Some of the tricks would have been hard enough on a controlled stage but he even did them on the street! Biting the quarter, the cigarette through the quarter, the card inside the window, the card in the girls pocket, and of course the levitation... Either the audience was in on it (hard to believe they were such good actors though) or he is <B>really</B> good! I'd like to see him live.<P>||||reg||14
