Z||000012||Cliff Pennock||09-04-2001||06:30 PM||||I can do all the tricks he does - really, it isn't all that difficult. Even the leviatation thingy (scares the sh-t out of people  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">). When I first saw the show I was impressed too and started reading about it. Now I'm not that impressed anymore.<P>Keep in mind that although it looks like a documentary of a street artist, it's actually a very clever production video with as much preparation as a David Copperfield (outside) show. But where Copperfield chooses for a big hollywood style entourage, Blaine chose for this documentary style. Very, very clever indeed. The guy made muchos dineros selling the show and selling videos...||||reg||1
